-# Overrides app/views/shared/_house_thanks_line.html.haml.
-# Theater Wit's thank-you sentence, as it read before the copy was
-# genericized: the house's identity is bound up with the storefront companies
-# that rent its stages, and the sentence says so.
= "Thank you for supporting #{theater_info.name} and the many storefront theaters that make our home so special."
- if theater_info.phone.present?
  = "If you have any questions, please #{local_assigns.fetch(:phone_phrase, 'call our box office at')} #{theater_info.phone}."
